        "zh": {
          "title": "達美執行長反對希斯洛換航廈計畫　2028年將與維珍分開營運",
          "summary": "達美航空執行長批評希斯洛機場要求2028年遷往第四航廈的安排，認為不利旅客。",
          "body": [
            "據Simple Flying於11月14日發布的報導，達美航空執行長Ed Bastian公開反對倫敦希斯洛機場（LHR）要求達美於2028年遷往第四航廈的決定。這項安排將使達美與維珍大西洋航空分開使用航廈。",
            "Bastian批評該決定缺乏長遠考量，並認為會損害航空旅客權益。這是航空公司對未來航廈配置提出的異議，遷移時間為2028年。"
          ]
        },
        "en": {
          "title": "Delta CEO objects to Heathrow Terminal 4 move planned for 2028",
          "summary": "Ed Bastian criticized a planned Heathrow terminal move that would separate Delta from Virgin Atlantic.",
          "body": [
            "Simple Flying reported on November 14 that Delta Air Lines CEO Ed Bastian had publicly opposed Heathrow Airport (LHR)’s decision to move Delta to Terminal 4 in 2028, separating it from Virgin Atlantic.",
            "Bastian argued that the decision lacked long-term thinking and would harm passengers. His comments concern a future terminal arrangement scheduled for 2028."
          ]
